00:48:25,910 --> 00:48:37,550
the vocabulary that we use in our books is not in most dictionaries and grammar checkers and spelling checkers aren't that happy with technical content.

494
00:48:37,550 --> 00:48:40,630
I don't know if you've if you've ever tried turning a grammar checker on,

