00:48:40,630 --> 00:48:49,710
but a lot of the times we use nouns as verbs and this kind of thing and they just go, you know,

496
00:48:49,710 --> 00:48:59,591
it's all red scribbles if you Yeah, I use um JetBrains' RustRover IDE for writing My code and the markdown and it's forever trying to correct stuff. Yeah.

