00:52:32,230 --> 00:52:38,470
The idea is that if you're Say you're Yeah, you're writing something and you know you want to talk about this, but you haven't got around to it yet.

534
00:52:38,470 --> 00:52:46,350
If you put in a cross-reference to the section and it doesn't exist, then the book will still build, but it will build with a warning to say you don't have this.

