And I think as generations change and as people's attention span changes, we have been going more and more to these shorter books and they are the ones that are popular.

615
01:00:12,870 --> 01:00:15,151
A lot of us are true. They are increasingly popular.

616
01:00:15,151 --> 01:00:17,710
So, yeah, and they're easier to write.

617
01:00:17,710 --> 01:00:21,550
So, I think a couple of Express books would be a very nice next step.

